<title>INDIA: India's Torrent Pharma 96/97 profit rises.</title>
<headline>India's Torrent Pharma 96/97 profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Torrent Pharmaceuticals Ltd's year to March gross profit increased by 19.46 percent to 494.2 million rupees ($13.8 million) from 413.7 million rupees last year, the Press Trust of India (PTI) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Torrent's 1996/97 sales increased to 3.18 billion rupees from 2.99 billion rupees in the previous year, PTI said.</p>
<p>The company has set a dividend of 60 percent for 1996/97 compared to 35 percent last year, it said. ($1 = 35.8 rupees)</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
